    Take icli 0.7.7 so a Mac fix without altitude reaches the guest
    
    A Mac's CoreLocation fix has vertical accuracy -1 (no altitude). IcliKit
    0.7.6 refused it with "vertical accuracy must be 0 or more metres", so
    every location.set from Sync Host Location failed. 0.7.7 accepts -1 as an
    unknown altitude.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

